Package: mordew
Title: Build, Test and Ship 'MCP' Servers as R Packages
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Colin", "Fay", , "contact@colinfay.me", role = c("cre", "aut"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7343-1846")),
    person("ThinkR", role = "cph")
  )
Description: An opinionated framework for building Model Context Protocol
    ('MCP') servers as R packages. Each tool is a documented and tested R
    function. The package provides scaffolding, a tool registry generated
    from 'roxygen2' documentation, testing helpers and deployment helpers.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    utils
Encoding: UTF-8
